### Import 100 products
POST http://localhost:8122/api/batch/import?count=100
Accept: application/json

### Update prices by percentage
PUT http://localhost:8122/api/batch/update-prices?category=Electronics&percentage=10
Accept: application/json

### Delete products with maxPrice 12
DELETE http://localhost:8122/api/batch/cleanup?maxPrice=12
Accept: application/json

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8122/api/batch/products
Accept: application/json
